f sprawling.\n\nSo from here, we’re not “studying NetSuite.” We’re rehearsing the rail, sharpening the handoff/validation language, and building a few proof stories under each stage so Wednesday feels conversational rather than memorized. That’s a much better use of the next couple days. memcite", "text_chars": 656, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "077c935a-12e1-4181-83af-82ab397b395a", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789363429.473215, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "60c4d8e5-042d-45f9-b047-0a6bdf10a381", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789363771.301487, "updated_at": 1789363805.857585, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "And I have one more ask from this side. So can you look up the financial, I guess growth pattern of both MHI and NetSuite and Oracle as a whole? Because I'm curious what has happened in the past three years.", "text_chars": 207, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "e3a8579b-705f-4d40-8dad-9f2d791e2923", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789363772.037245, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "web.run", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gp