cle. Requirements. Scope.**\n\nAnd yes, from here the prep changes completely. We’re not going to build some giant study curriculum. We’re going to run cases conversationally and I’ll stop you when needed:\n\n“Peter, wrong altitude.”  \n“Peter, you just took ownership of development.”  \n“Peter, that was architecture when Andrew asked about delivery.”  \n“Peter, you skipped validation.”  \n“Peter, good answer, stop talking.”  \n“Peter, use requirements there, not ‘what they need.’”\n\nThat’s the fun part now. We’ve got the structure. The rest is reps.", "text_chars": 1114, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "c984dd64-4981-479e-b37d-55580a356b0a", "role": "tool", "role_name": "api_tool.call_tool", "created_at": 1789365129.673649, "updated_at": 1789365138.92772, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "code", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "bc7bce9c-6503-4003-a102-a389582b7f57", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789365133.22377, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "thoughts", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "8066fcc0-2592-4e78-bdaa-97fc580c073b", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1789365133.226649, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "li